    "faqTitle": "FAQ",
    "faqQuestion1": "When is the payment made?",
    "faqAnswer1": "When booking with us, you will only pay management fees. The rest of the amount will be paid directly at the hotel upon check-in, with your preferred payment method. In some hotels, it will be necessary to pay the total amount of the reservation at the time of confirmation. This information will be displayed before finalizing the reservation.",
    "faqQuestion2": "Can I book a room if I am a minor?",
    "faqAnswer2": "No, to book a room it is mandatory to be of legal age. If you wonder whether your partner, being of legal age, can make the reservation for you, unfortunately it is not possible. A minor can only access the room if accompanied by a parent or legal guardian. For security and government regulations, presenting a valid identification document is strictly mandatory for all people registering at the hotel.",
    "faqQuestion3": "Is it possible to stay with more than two people in the same reservation?",
    "faqAnswer3": "Generally, our double rooms have a maximum capacity of two people, and the price indicated on the website corresponds to the total stay per room. In any case, you can make a request (which must be approved by the hotel).",
    "faqQuestion4": "Do I have to present my identification?",
    "faqAnswer4": "Yes, it is mandatory to present a valid identification document for all persons checking in at the hotel. If a valid document is not presented, the hotel reserves the right to charge the reservation.",
    "faqQuestion5": "I want to modify my reservation",
    "faqAnswer5": "Since your reservation has been managed with Romio, only we can modify it. We are improving this process to make it easier, but for now please contact us indicating which reservation detail you would like to modify and we will get in touch with the hotel to send them your request. Remember that this decision depends entirely on the hotel, so we cannot guarantee that the modification will always be possible.",
