    "profilePrivacyPolicy": "Privacy Policy",
    "privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
    "termsTitle": "Terms and Conditions",
    "privacySection1Title": "1. Data Controller Romio C.A., RIF:",
    "privacySection1Text": "V-25754567-9, with tax address at Av. Ppal de las Palmas, Distrito Capital. Venezuela. Contact email: info@getromio.app",
    "privacySection2Title": "2. What data we collect",
    "privacySection2Text1": "Romio collects personal data voluntarily provided by the user when registering, making a reservation, or contacting customer service. Collected data may include, among others:",
    "privacySection2Bullet1": "First and last name.",
    "privacySection2Bullet2": "Email address.",
    "privacySection2Bullet3": "Phone number.",
    "privacySection2Bullet4": "Information related to reservations made, including times, dates, amounts, room type, stay, and reservation status.",
    "privacySection2Bullet5": "Any other information voluntarily provided by the user for proper service delivery.",
    "privacySection2Text2": "Additionally, Romio may collect technical and statistical information about app usage, such as device type, operating system, app version, usage hours, number of reservations made, and platform interactions, to improve services and optimize user experience.",
    "privacySection3Title": "3. Why we use the data. Personal data will be used for the following purposes:",
    "privacySection3Bullet1": "Managing reservations made by the user.",
    "privacySection3Bullet2": "Facilitating service delivery by the selected hotel. Communicating with the user regarding reservations, incidents, or inquiries.",
    "privacySection3Bullet3": "Providing assistance and support. Improving application performance, operation, and security.",
    "privacySection3Bullet4": "Creating internal statistics and reports to improve our services.",
    "privacySection3Bullet5": "Complying with applicable legal obligations.",
    "privacySection4Title": "4. Data Recipients",
    "privacySection4Text1": "Romio does not sell, rent, or transfer users' personal data for commercial purposes.",
    "privacySection4Text2": "However, to properly manage a reservation, Romio may communicate strictly necessary data to the corresponding hotel for the correct provision of the requested service. Likewise, Romio may share information with technology or service providers when strictly necessary for platform operation, always under confidentiality obligations.",
    "privacySection5Title": "5. Data Security",
    "privacySection5Text1": "Romio adopts reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect personal data against unauthorized access, loss, alteration, disclosure, or unauthorized processing.",
    "privacySection5Text2": "However, no electronic transmission or storage system can guarantee absolute security, so Romio cannot ensure the total absence of risks arising from Internet use.",
    "privacySection6Title": "6. Data Retention",
    "privacySection6Text": "Personal data will be retained for the time necessary to manage the user relationship, process reservations, and comply with applicable legal obligations. Once these purposes end, data may only be kept in anonymized form for statistical or service improvement purposes.",
    "privacySection7Title": "7. User Rights",
    "privacySection7Text1": "The user may request at any time:",
    "privacySection7Bullet1": "Access their personal data.",
    "privacySection7Bullet2": "Rectify inaccurate data.",
    "privacySection7Bullet3": "Request deletion of their data when applicable.",
    "privacySection7Bullet4": "Update provided information.",
    "privacySection7Bullet5": "Submit any inquiry regarding processing of their data.",
    "privacySection7Text2": "Requests may be made via email to info@getromio.app",
    "privacySection8Title": "8. Cookies and similar technologies",
    "privacySection8Text": "The application may use technologies similar to cookies or device identifiers to improve user experience, analyze platform performance, and optimize application efficiency.",
    "privacySection9Title": "9. Changes to Privacy Policy",
    "privacySection9Text": "Romio may modify this Privacy Policy at any time to adapt to legal, technical, or operational changes. Modifications will be published in the app and take effect upon publication unless specified otherwise.",
    "privacySection10Title": "10. Contact",
    "privacySection10Text": "If the user has any questions about this Privacy Policy or data processing, they may contact Romio via email: info@getromio.app",
    "termsSection1Title": "1. Company / owner identification",
    "termsSection1Text": "Romio C.A., RIF: V-25754567-9, registered at Av. Ppal de las Palmas, Distrito Capital. Venezuela. Contact email: info@getromio.app",
    "termsSection2Title": "2. Acceptance of conditions",
    "termsSection2Text": "Use of the Romio mobile app implies full and unconditional acceptance of these Terms and Conditions. By accessing or using the platform, the user confirms having read, understood, and accepted these rules. If the user disagrees with any term, they must refrain from using the application.",
    "termsSection3Title": "3. User requirements",
    "termsSection3Text": "Room booking through the app is strictly reserved for persons of legal age (18 years or older).\nBy making a reservation, the user declares and warrants compliance with this requirement. Romio reserves the right to cancel any reservation or suspend service if the user does not meet the minimum age requirement.",
    "termsSection4Title": "4. Service",
    "termsSection4Text": "Romio is an intermediary platform that facilitates hourly hotel room bookings quickly and easily.\nRomio does not own or directly manage the hotels offered on the platform. The final provision of accommodation services is the sole responsibility of each hotel.",
    "termsSection5Title": "5. Payments",
    "termsSection5Text": "When making a reservation through Romio, the user will pay the management fees in the app.\nThe remaining reservation amount will be paid directly at the hotel at check-in using payment methods accepted by the establishment. Where full upfront payment is required, this will be communicated before reservation confirmation.",
    "termsSection6Title": "6. Cancellations and modifications",
    "termsSection6Text": "Since reservations are managed through Romio, any modification or cancellation request must be made through official app contact channels.\nRequests are subject to the approval and policies of the respective hotel, so Romio cannot guarantee acceptance of modifications or refunds in all cases.",
    "termsSection7Title": "7. Proper use of the app",
    "termsSection7Text": "The user agrees to make proper and lawful use of the application and its services.\nMaking fake, fraudulent, or unlawful bookings, as well as interfering with platform functionality, is strictly prohibited.",
    "termsSection8Title": "8. Intellectual Property",
    "termsSection8Text": "All content, trademarks, logos, text, images, graphic design, and source code of Romio are the exclusive property of Romio C.A. or its licensors and are protected by intellectual property laws. Reproduction, distribution, or modification without prior written authorization is prohibited.",
    "termsSection9Title": "9. Terms Modification",
    "termsSection9Text": "Romio reserves the right to modify these Terms and Conditions at any time. Modifications take effect upon publication in the app. Continued use of the platform following modifications implies acceptance.",
    "termsSection10Title": "10. Law and jurisdiction",
    "termsSection10Text": "These Terms and Conditions shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws. Any dispute arising from app use shall be submitted to the competent courts."
